fficer Final Answer Key Page displaying.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">For Downloading their final answer key Candidates will be redirected to the Login Page here they have provide their following details-:</span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Registration Number</strong></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Password/DOB</strong></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Click in the ‘Login’ Icon.</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Candidates can also download their RSSB Aayush Officer Final Answer Key from official site of the RSSB</span>.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>RSSB Aayush Officer Recruitment 2025 : Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Written Exam</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Document Verification</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Medical Examination</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable2\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><strong>Follow SarkariExam on Instagram</strong></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span 